{"2966570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Impostor Online", "steam_appid": 2966570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4734460], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impostor Online</strong> is a multiplayer murder mystery and social deduction game for 4–16 players, inspired by <i>Werewolf</i> and <i>Town of Salem</i>. Every match, you're dealt a secret role. Someone at the table wants you dead. Find them first—or make sure they never find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, killers strike while other roles investigate, heal, or scheme in secret. When morning comes, everyone argues, accuses, lies, and votes to execute a suspect. Repeat until one faction claims victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three factions compete for control of the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Civilians</strong> hunt down every killer before it's too late.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impostors</strong> eliminate the town until they outnumber the Civilians.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neutrals</strong> pursue their own unique win conditions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Impostors</strong> are the murderers. They recognize one another at night, coordinate in secret, and choose one player to eliminate. They win once they outnumber the Civilians and no other killers remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/280c1da357e23950b0982debeb5d2595.poster.avif?t=1786864826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/280c1da357e23950b0982debeb5d2595.webm?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/280c1da357e23950b0982debeb5d2595.mp4?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Investigator</strong> is the town's eyes. Each night, investigate one player and discover their exact role. The hard part is what you do with the truth. Reveal it too soon, and you might become the killers' next target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/8c4cdd0760a53b79e130746af4a9fce3.poster.avif?t=1786864826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/8c4cdd0760a53b79e130746af4a9fce3.webm?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/8c4cdd0760a53b79e130746af4a9fce3.mp4?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Nurse</strong> heals one player each night. Guess right and the killers strike an empty bed. But she can't heal the same player two nights running—and nobody ever thanks you for the kill that didn't happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/7b7f029700c2ad39dfaf13375b879a80.poster.avif?t=1786864826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/7b7f029700c2ad39dfaf13375b879a80.webm?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/7b7f029700c2ad39dfaf13375b879a80.mp4?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hunter</strong> doesn't go quietly. If they're murdered at night or lynched during the day, they get one final shot for revenge. Lynch carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/1c2059420bbc9e8e3518e8fe30f5b1ac.poster.avif?t=1786864826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/1c2059420bbc9e8e3518e8fe30f5b1ac.webm?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/1c2059420bbc9e8e3518e8fe30f5b1ac.mp4?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Killer</strong> has no allies. They murder one player each night and win only by becoming the last person alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/2815b160addc35e8cb908f276f2f76df.poster.avif?t=1786864826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/2815b160addc35e8cb908f276f2f76df.webm?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/2815b160addc35e8cb908f276f2f76df.mp4?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Jester</strong> thrives on chaos. Their goal: get lynched. Act suspicious, make terrible arguments, and let the town do the rest. Once lynched, they unleash a live bomb that can be passed from player to player before exploding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/780b1675679ffff343874d720a18c67e.poster.avif?t=1786864826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/780b1675679ffff343874d720a18c67e.webm?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/780b1675679ffff343874d720a18c67e.mp4?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morning brings accusations, desperate defenses, and a public vote. Read the room, bluff with confidence, and trust no one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/1d0645b2f45c506aebb6ec4c8516668c.poster.avif?t=1786864826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/1d0645b2f45c506aebb6ec4c8516668c.webm?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/1d0645b2f45c506aebb6ec4c8516668c.mp4?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4–16 players online</strong>: create a private lobby with friends or jump into public matchmaking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice and text chat</strong>: accuse, defend, and bluff in real time—your voice is your strongest weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique roles across three factions</strong>: investigate, heal, deceive, or hunt your way to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong>: unlock outfits, hats, and accessories to create your own style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and statistics</strong>: earn XP, unlock cosmetics and titles, and climb the ranks.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impostor Online</strong> is a multiplayer murder mystery and social deduction game for 4–16 players, inspired by <i>Werewolf</i> and <i>Town of Salem</i>. Every match, you're dealt a secret role. Someone at the table wants you dead. Find them first—or make sure they never find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, killers strike while other roles investigate, heal, or scheme in secret. When morning comes, everyone argues, accuses, lies, and votes to execute a suspect. Repeat until one faction claims victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three factions compete for control of the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Civilians</strong> hunt down every killer before it's too late.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impostors</strong> eliminate the town until they outnumber the Civilians.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neutrals</strong> pursue their own unique win conditions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Impostors</strong> are the murderers. They recognize one another at night, coordinate in secret, and choose one player to eliminate. They win once they outnumber the Civilians and no other killers remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/280c1da357e23950b0982debeb5d2595.poster.avif?t=1786864826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/280c1da357e23950b0982debeb5d2595.webm?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/280c1da357e23950b0982debeb5d2595.mp4?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Investigator</strong> is the town's eyes. Each night, investigate one player and discover their exact role. The hard part is what you do with the truth. Reveal it too soon, and you might become the killers' next target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/8c4cdd0760a53b79e130746af4a9fce3.poster.avif?t=1786864826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/8c4cdd0760a53b79e130746af4a9fce3.webm?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/8c4cdd0760a53b79e130746af4a9fce3.mp4?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Nurse</strong> heals one player each night. Guess right and the killers strike an empty bed. But she can't heal the same player two nights running—and nobody ever thanks you for the kill that didn't happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/7b7f029700c2ad39dfaf13375b879a80.poster.avif?t=1786864826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/7b7f029700c2ad39dfaf13375b879a80.webm?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/7b7f029700c2ad39dfaf13375b879a80.mp4?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hunter</strong> doesn't go quietly. If they're murdered at night or lynched during the day, they get one final shot for revenge. Lynch carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/1c2059420bbc9e8e3518e8fe30f5b1ac.poster.avif?t=1786864826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/1c2059420bbc9e8e3518e8fe30f5b1ac.webm?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/1c2059420bbc9e8e3518e8fe30f5b1ac.mp4?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Killer</strong> has no allies. They murder one player each night and win only by becoming the last person alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/2815b160addc35e8cb908f276f2f76df.poster.avif?t=1786864826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/2815b160addc35e8cb908f276f2f76df.webm?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/2815b160addc35e8cb908f276f2f76df.mp4?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Jester</strong> thrives on chaos. Their goal: get lynched. Act suspicious, make terrible arguments, and let the town do the rest. Once lynched, they unleash a live bomb that can be passed from player to player before exploding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/780b1675679ffff343874d720a18c67e.poster.avif?t=1786864826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/780b1675679ffff343874d720a18c67e.webm?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/780b1675679ffff343874d720a18c67e.mp4?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morning brings accusations, desperate defenses, and a public vote. Read the room, bluff with confidence, and trust no one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/1d0645b2f45c506aebb6ec4c8516668c.poster.avif?t=1786864826\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/1d0645b2f45c506aebb6ec4c8516668c.webm?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966570/extras/1d0645b2f45c506aebb6ec4c8516668c.mp4?t=1786864826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4–16 players online</strong>: create a private lobby with friends or jump into public matchmaking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice and text chat</strong>: accuse, defend, and bluff in real time—your voice is your strongest weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique roles across three factions</strong>: investigate, heal, deceive, or hunt your way to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong>: unlock outfits, hats, and accessories to create your own style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and statistics</strong>: earn XP, unlock cosmetics and titles, and climb the ranks.</p></li></ul>", "short_des